### 1. Health Check - Auth Service
GET http://localhost:8001/health

### 2. Health Check - User Service
GET http://localhost:8002/health

### 3. Health Check - Analytics Service
GET http://localhost:8003/health

### 4. Login (MOST IMPORTANT TEST)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Extract token and test protected route
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Get Current User
GET http://localhost:8002/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Create Event
POST http://localhost:8003/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "test_user_123",
  "eventType": "page_view",
  "eventData": {
    "page": "/dashboard",
    "duration": 30
  }
}

### 8. List Events
GET http://localhost:8003/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}